        "name": "Required check",
        "score": 5,
        "rationale": "No concurrency group was added, but `test` and the label-driven work still share one workflow and trigger list, and the job-level `if` only makes `test` show as skipped on `labeled`; that skipped `test` check run on the same head SHA can satisfy a required check and hide an earlier failing run, so the trigger sets are not truly disjoint (moving e2e to its own workflow would make them disjoint)."
      },
      {
        "name": "Behavior",
